{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0227",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "「上次也是發生在年末，這個時候大家都忙得團團轉，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The last time it happened was at the end of the year too, when everyone was run off their feet,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "可偏偏在年末幹出這樣的事，存心是想讓我也搭上一條命。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but choosing the end of the year to do something like this is practically trying to drag me down with him too.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "比目魚跟京橋那家小酒館的老闆娘發著這樣的牢騷。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hirame was grumbling like this to the proprietress of that little bar in Kyobashi.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "「老闆娘。」我喊道。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Madam,\" I called out.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "「嗯，什麼事？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Yes, what is it?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "你醒過神來了？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Have you come to your senses?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "老闆娘的笑臉好像摞在我的臉上，回答道。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The madam answered as if her smiling face were laid over mine.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "我愴然淚下。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I burst into sorrowful tears.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "「讓我與良子分手吧。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Please let me break up with Yoshiko.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "連自己都覺得意外，竟然說出這樣的話。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even I was surprised that such words had come out of my mouth.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "老闆娘站起身，輕輕地嘆了口氣。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The madam sat up and let out a faint sigh.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "接下來我又失言了，而且更加意外，不知該說是滑稽還是愚蠢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then I misspoke again, even more unexpectedly, in a way I could hardly tell was comic or merely foolish.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "「我要去沒有女人的地方。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I want to go somewhere there are no women.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00227",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "「哈哈哈。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Ha ha ha.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
